Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 21:41:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 34/63] dns: the transports group and provider

A server of the type group asks its servers in order and, after one gave no answer in time, the rest
together; provider is the DNS of the provider netifd knows.

Made of these commits of the earlier series (branch archive/r25-1.14-commits):
  1df7d9ac8 dns: servers of the types group and provider
  321ff5826 dns: a group asks the rest of its servers together after one gave no answer in time

Pdk-Feature: dns-group
Pdk-Zone: core
Pdk-Layer: 03
